# Grade 5 Area 1 MVP Current Plan

Quiz-system implementation is temporarily on hold.

The only approved current gameplay implementation target is:

```text
Grade 5 LiteraQuest Term 1 Mission 1
Festival Storybook Rescue
Area 1 only: Parade Meadow
```

Do not implement the full Grade 5 mission yet. Do not implement Grade 6 yet. Do not implement Mission 2 or any future mission.

The project owner designs and places the environment objects and dynamic Canvas UI. The AI agent implements only the game logic, data binding, and wiring.

Use this loop only:

```text
Explore -> interact with Farmer Lira -> dialogue -> inspect Parade Clue Set / Knowledge Lock -> answer 3 questions -> wrong answer gives hint -> correct answers unlock Story Map Fragment -> pick up Story Map Fragment -> gate opens -> Area Complete panel
```

Required scene objects are described in:

```text
docs/unity/06B_LITERAQUEST_MISSION1_SCENE_OBJECT_AND_ASSET_CHECKLIST.md
```

Required implementation steps are described in:

```text
docs/unity/06C_LITERAQUEST_MISSION1_AI_AGENT_IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md
```

Canvas/uGUI is the expected mission UI approach for this MVP. Use owner-designed UI panels where available. Use TextMeshPro for dynamic dialogue, questions, answers, objectives, feedback, collectible counts, and area completion messages. Do not bake dynamic mission content into images.

Use local ScriptableObject or JSON data first. Do not require Laravel/server mission APIs for this MVP.

Do not implement:

```text
Grade 5 Area 2
Grade 5 Area 3
Grade 5 final storybook stage
Grade 6 Mission 1
Health/PE missions
Science missions
server mission tracking
teacher-authored missions
reward shop
coins
EXP
economy inventory
pets
cosmetics
equipment
world restoration
drag-and-drop minigames
audio requirements
VFX requirements
```

Audio and VFX can be added later. The current MVP must work without them.
